@startuml seq-drm
title Поток данных: защита контента (DRM + Watermark)

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor Viewer as viewer
rectangle "Client Player\n(TEE)" as player
rectangle "CDN Edge" as cdn
rectangle "Video Serving" as serving
rectangle "Watermark Service" as wm
rectangle "DRM License Server" as license

viewer   --> player  : Play premium content
player   --> cdn     : GET manifest
cdn      --> serving : origin pull
serving  --> wm      : generate session watermark\n(user_id, device, timestamp)
wm       --> serving : watermark token
serving  --> cdn     : manifest (key_id, no key, wm_token)
cdn      --> player  : manifest

player   --> license : key_id + device_token + session
license  --> player  : AES key\n(L1 → 4K HDR | L3/Chrome → 720p)

cdn      --> player  : encrypted chunks (.m4s)
player   --> player  : decrypt in TEE → render\n(watermark встроен в поток)

note bottom of license
  проверяет: подписку, geo,
  device attestation, Widevine level
end note

note bottom of player
  screen capture обходит DRM,
  но не watermark →
  пиратская копия → извлечь метку → аккаунт/время
end note

@enduml
